 "en-US-JennyNeural\u0000Still on the ground floor, there is our main restaurant, which serves breakfast, lunch and dinner. Opposite the restaurant, there is a small café for coffee and snacks. At the back of the hotel, there is a quiet garden and a modern spa. Under the building, there is a car park for guests.":{f:"e922e0c8b5c0138b",d:19.056,v:0.770,a:0.160,b:18.240,wd:[0.2, 0.57, 0.8, 1.01, 1.44, 1.8, 2.25, 2.44, 2.69, 3.0, 3.76, 4.04, 4.44, 5.23, 5.61, 5.86, 6.32, 6.91, 7.16, 7.91, 8.36, 8.56, 8.58, 8.96, 9.2, 9.52, 9.96, 10.21, 10.7, 10.89, 11.08, 11.56, 11.58, 12.0, 12.32, 12.69, 12.96, 12.98, 13.37, 13.81, 14.06, 14.18, 14.62, 14.93, 15.3, 15.52, 16.17, 16.52, 16.73, 16.88, 17.2, 17.48, 17.66],e:"-sWqQaZIOqogMPWPLKIE0000bhdbQMbE0EFYjcF00KZQ0000QPEKcZXPKEIK00FNI0000000000000000000000",w:"00-------ONEIONDNaA-FOSRI6----EEBDKIHG9P----v-aMKd-UPIB9WlZM97KUV----IIHIG5-------Jc----RI----MQRU---TWg-------6CUZeD----eXA3-XWEWMFCBs------------00000000---SPGaT---SY-L9ISU----KIHII6-------vZNL--m----7ILGU--XUb--dhcS--IIX--jQL--XcPSnhDv---PecPKKu----------0000000000000000---nQQqJ8ALUTL-MI-OWdGGG--wWXSNGC8B----uRIIy-cNe-oEQagX8bTLLLJC646U-ZQgG69ILMwPK99---INMKHKbt--0000000000000000---XN8uIGZG2-PQMKsjeS628m---ZPIK--RX---NLICgxZMIL---HD4-egXVN-------------00000000000000000",r:"--0000000denjdeoeRr0mdZajv0000nnqohjklsc000060RfhO0XcjqsWGSfsuhXW0000jjkjlw0000000iP0000aj0000fbaX000YWL0000000vpXSNo0000NUry0UVnVfmpq9000000000000--------000ZclRY000ZT0gsjZX0000hjkjjv00000006Seg00F0000ujglX00UXQ00OKPZ00jjU00Ibg00UPcZEKo6000cNPchh70000000000----------------000EbbBitrgXYg0fj0dWOlll005VUZelptq00007ajj30PeN0DnbRLUtQYgggipvxvX0SbLlvsjgf5chss000jefhkhQ800----------------000Uet7jlSlz0cbfh9INZvztF000Scjh00aU000egjpL4Sfjg000kox0NLUWe0000000000000-----------------"},
